      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "It's that time of year again—Qixi is just around the corner, and FENDI has just dropped its \"Heartbeat\" capsule collection for the occasion. The accessories line features jewelry crafted from metal and resin, shaped into horn motifs and heart symbols inspired by ancient Roman engravings found on stone columns. Meanwhile, the silk scarves showcase gradient heart prints that call to mind romantic rose petals scattered in the breeze.",
