      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The designer uses organic glass to sculpt romantic, dimensional heart shapes—the collection's name, \"Heartbeat,\" says it all. A fiery red matte coating gives these hearts a passionate yet refined look, while the translucent quality of the organic glass adds an airy, luminous feel. At the end of the necklace and bracelet, a metal plaque dangles, adding a sweet, affectionate touch to any outfit.",
